Sublist marker interrupts a continuation paragraph

```
- first

  second
  - nested
.
<ul>
  <li><p>first</p>
    <p>second</p>
    <ul>
      <li>nested</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- first

  second
  1. nested
.
<ul>
  <li><p>first</p>
    <p>second</p>
    <ol>
      <li>nested</li>
    </ol>
  </li>
</ul>
```
